    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114116" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλᾰνίδ-ιον</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐδ]</span>, τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλανίς,</span> mostly of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a woman's mantle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.195
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Chaerem.
				14.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Trag.Adesp.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				110
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				1190
			</span></i> (lyr.): pl., of <i>blankets, bedclothes,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				42
			</span></i>: later, = Lat. <i>paludamentum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i>
			<i>ad Ath.</i><i><span class="en">
				277a
			</span></i>; contemptuously addressed to Cicero, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ λεπτά σου χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					46.18
				</span></i>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλάνδιον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>Michel</u>
				832.30
			</span></i> (Samos, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5633.13
			</span></i> (near Teos).</div>
